Fetched Components
===================

RAMSES, STEPSS-Helios, DYNGRAPH (on Linux and macOS), and CODEGEN are not
committed to this repository. The build downloads the pinned per-platform
binaries from their respective SPS-L GitHub releases and verifies each
against a checksum recorded in versions.properties before packaging it into
the jar; this does not change the licensing terms above. The Windows
DYNGRAPH build bundled here is committed directly, as the published DYNGRAPH
releases are console-only and do not include the dialog-based build STEPSS
uses on Windows.

